<title>EGYPT: EGYPT POUND O/N RATE STEADY, AVG WEEKLY RISES.</title>
<headline>EGYPT POUND O/N RATE STEADY, AVG WEEKLY RISES.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Egyptian pound were mostly steady in a short private sector market on Wednesday at between 8-3/4 and 9-1/2 percent compared to Tuesday's range of 8-7/8 and 9-3/8 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates were 9-1/2 percent compared to a range of 8-7/8 and 9-1/2 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
